### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Valid subscribe (sends a real email, use your own address)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "your-email@example.com" }

### Invalid email (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }

### Missing email (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{}
